From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Draven <dravengarden@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 01:05:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add the Cowboy native image profile

The `image-v1` managed profile delegates native image generation and
editing. It keeps every managed restriction, requires native image
generation and a supported ChatGPT account before the turn, sets image
base instructions, and reports a generated image once in typed ACP
content instead of duplicating its base64 in rawOutput.

Cowboy-Delta: native-image-profile
Upstream: cowboy-specific
Drop-When: Cowboy image calls stop launching codex-acp with the image-v1 profile
Tests: src/__tests__/CowboyImageProfile.test.ts

